msgstr "Renovar tokens"

#: apps/accounts/views/auth.py:121
msgid ""
"Rotate the refresh token. Send `refresh` in the body (Bearer clients) or "
"rely on the refresh cookie (browsers). A refresh read from the cookie is "
"answered with new cookies and never with tokens in the body; it requires a "
"CSRF token."
msgstr ""
"Rotaciona o token de refresh. Envie `refresh` no corpo (clientes Bearer) ou "
"use o cookie de refresh (navegadores). Uma leitura do refresh pelo cookie é "
"respondida com novos cookies e nunca com tokens no corpo; requer um token "
"CSRF."

